OL,3,GNEWSAOperator adds two trains as new
OL,4,Afleet delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) is set to
OL,7,Fadd 17,000 seats a week to its
OL,8,Fintercity services because of continued
OL,9,Fdelays of a new fleet of trains.
OL,11,FThe operator is bringing in two Class
OL,12,F221 trains, on lease from Grand
OL,13,FCentral, which will provide 10-carriage
OL,14,Ftrains on selected weekday services
OL,15,Fbetween Sheffield, Nottingham and
OL,16,FLondon St Pancras.
OL,18,FThe Class 221 trains are being
OL,19,Fintroduced on a "short-term basis" from
OL,20,F14 December following delays to the
OL,21,Fdelivery of EMR's new Class 810 Aurora
OL,22,Ftrains by Hitachi Rail.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
